      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the top contractors and industries in North Dakota?",
        "body": "NORIDIAN HEALTHCARE SOLUTIONS, LLC is the top vendor with $328M in obligations, followed by WALSH FEDERAL LLC at $74.4M and PACKET DIGITAL LLC at $36.8M. Direct Health and Medical Insurance Carriers leads industries with $291M, and Commercial and Institutional Building Construction follows with $137M."
      }
